Package: planarsviz
Title: Visualizations for Planar Constituency Analyses
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jeff", "Good", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jcgood@buffalo.edu")
Author: Jeff Good [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jeff Good <jcgood@buffalo.edu>
Description:
    Reusable, data-driven visualizations for planar constituency and
    laminar-family analyses. Analytical family enumeration remains outside
    this package; the package reads a data bundle exported by
    scripts/analysis/export_planarsviz_data.py and returns plot objects.
    Being rebuilt chart by chart; see docs/PLAN_planarsviz_library.md.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    grid,
    jsonlite,
    magrittr,
    patchwork,
    scales,
    stats,
    stringr,
    tidyr,
    utils
Suggests:
    ape,
    ggtree
